  "scientific_readout": [
    "The four reduced-viable-self gate cells show selected 2/25/14/58 versus neutral 0/18/5/48 surviving out of 64; direction all positive, but all conservative 95% intervals overlap zero and none establish >5pp improvement.",
    "Untreated arms have three empirical saturation/ceiling cells and one small difference 62/64 versus 59/64.",
    "Selected inheritance is associated with larger assurance allele values in several conditional common-survivor comparisons; those are survivor-conditioned post-outcome descriptions, NOT an identified mediation or general genetic selection coefficient.",
    "The neutral operator retains original source absolute viable seed output and realized mating channel counts, but randomizes inheritance parent pairs uniformly within mating mode; genetic drift remains and physical maternal seed budgets do not describe the artificial reassignment.",
